# The Planetary Council's window (CouncWin, see src/ui/councwin.c) in a hotseat or e-mail game (a poke sets the flag the game keeps for one, at
# 0x93a95c, before the window opens): the window starts with every faction's arrival marked and the Council waiting on its players (the
# word at 0x703de8). Return before the player has voted fills in the AIs' votes; the player's own Yea decides the vote and, as in such a
# game, puts the other buttons away and leaves OK; Escape then ends the window. A second window, with the player's vote poked in but the
# vote not decided, ends on Escape without carrying anything out (the light closing for a game that waits on its players). The state
# regions are as in councwin_vote.scene.
# Leave time after each step; the snaps take 2 s each.
25 load
